@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| J&J local contacts
|a_default|
start
:Identify the business need;
:Gather the business requirements;
split
:Create the RFP;
split again
:Create a scorecard from the business requirements;
end split
:Submit the RFP to vendors;
:Score the proposals received from vendors;
split
:Request a response from vendors by a set date;
split again
:Downselect vendors based on scored proposals to present their proposals;
end split
:Receive proposals from downselected vendors;
:Score the proposals again;
:Attend presentations and conduct Q and A sessions;
:Rescore proposals based on presentations and Q and A;
:Is pricing and scope adjustment necessary;
:v1: Is pricing and scope adjustment necessary ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 == "Yes"])
:Request pricing and scope adjustments;
:Review updated proposals and rescore;
else ([v1 == "No"])
->;
endif
:Notify vendors of selection;
:Create contract based on winning proposal;
stop
@enduml